## SDK shortcuts

`@vtc/sdk` with `apiBaseUrl: getVtcApiUrl()` (`vtc-packages.mdc`):

```typescript
sdk.getUserInfo()
sdk.getMembers(20, 0)   // paginated; not the same as member-list expansion
sdk.getGroupInfo()
```

For **member lists and group roles**, prefer explicit ZAPI routes above — SDK coverage may be incomplete. Jobs uses direct `fetch` in `posifApi.ts`.

