## Recommended document shape (private resource)

```typescript
type AccessControlled = {
  visibility: 'private' | 'network'  // network = all in group; private = ACL
  createdBy: string                  // user_id — always has access
  allowedUserIds?: string[]
  allowedRoleIds?: string[]
  allowedListIds?: string[]        // optional; merged into allowedUserIds on write
  memberLabels?: { userId: string; displayName: string }[]
  roleLabels?: { roleId: string; roleName: string }[]
  listLabels?: { listId: string; title: string }[]
}
```

Shared app: combine with `group_id` on every query (`data-model.mdc`).

